 the expression inside the parentheses:\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}-12x+35\n$$\n\nFirst, we rewrite the coefficient of the linear term as a product with $2$ as a factor:\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}-2\\cdot 6x+35\n$$\n\nThen, we *add* and *then subtract* ${6}^{2},$ writing the constant term $35$ last:\n\n$$\n{{x}^{2}-2\\cdot 6x+{6}^{2}}_{⏟}-{6}^{2}+35\n$$\n\nThe first three terms form a perfect square, which we factor as follows:\n\n$$\n(x-6)^{2}-{6}^{2}+35\n$$\n\nEvaluating the last two terms, we get\n\n$$\n(x-6)^{2}-1.\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute this result back into our original expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-({x}^{2}-12x+35) & =-({(x-6)}^{2}-1) \\\\  & =-{(x-6)}^{2}+1 \\\\  & =1-(x-6)^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-71c17160-e343-5b78-8eee-e55ba4967a40" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-0e21de81-a1b0-5b51-8bf2-2764e594128c" :answer-field/id #uuid "0e21de81-a1b0-5b51-8bf2-2764e594128c"] ["answer-b7dc3995-7e49-5218-bd7f-84bc849ae212" :answer/id #uuid "b7dc3995-7e49-5218-bd7f-84bc849ae212"] ["answer-b7dc3995-7e49-5218-bd7f-84bc849ae212" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b7dc3995-7e49-5218-bd7f-84bc849ae212" :answer/value "-1-(x+6)^{2}"] ["answer-ab8f5a47-f218-5790-b0cf-2c6bd714ec14" :answer/id #uuid "ab8f5a47-f218-5790-b0cf-2c6bd714ec14"] ["answer-ab8f5a47-f218-5790-b0cf-2c6bd714ec14" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-ab8f5a47-f218-5790-b0cf-2c6bd714ec14" :answer/value "-36-(x-6)^{2}"] ["answer-12fd1b63-f3c4-5f58-9b24-c3b8e327902e" :answer/id #uuid "12fd1b63-f3c4-5f58-9b24-c3b8e327902e"] ["answer-12fd1b63-f3c4-5f58-9b24-c3b8e327902e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-12fd1b63-f3c4-5f58-9b24-c3b8e327902e" :answer/value "1-(x-6)^{2}"] ["answer-f44e234d-afc4-503a-ae90-2371906eb7fb" :answer/id #uuid "f44e234d-afc4-503a-ae90-2371906eb7fb"] ["answer-f44e234d-afc4-503a-ae90-2371906eb7fb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-f44e234d-afc4-503a-ae90-2371906eb7fb" :answer/value "35-(x+6)^{2}"] ["answer-2def7528-a392-5c38-a317-849706e41d