tract* ${4}^{2},$ writing the constant term $60$ last:\n\n$$\n{{y}^{2}-2\\cdot 4y+{4}^{2}}_{⏟}-{4}^{2}+60\n$$\n\nThe first three terms form a perfect square, which we factor as follows:\n\n$$\n(y-4)^{2}-{4}^{2}+60\n$$\n\nEvaluating the last two terms, we get\n\n$$\n(y-4)^{2}+44.\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute this result back into our original expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-({y}^{2}-8y+60) & =-({(y-4)}^{2}+44) \\\\  & =-{(y-4)}^{2}-44 \\\\  & =-44-(y-4)^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-bb8a5938-134a-51c9-838d-3e4010a8ca50" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-f3ff7a4b-bfcf-57eb-b578-4dd542e44b32" :answer-field/id #uuid "f3ff7a4b-bfcf-57eb-b578-4dd542e44b32"] ["answer-b2f33409-e27b-5ceb-ba94-f59981011277" :answer/id #uuid "b2f33409-e27b-5ceb-ba94-f59981011277"] ["answer-b2f33409-e27b-5ceb-ba94-f59981011277" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b2f33409-e27b-5ceb-ba94-f59981011277" :answer/value "-44-(y-4)^{2}"] ["answer-4b141f66-de8e-506c-a57a-d99a3a23fc93" :answer/id #uuid "4b141f66-de8e-506c-a57a-d99a3a23fc93"] ["answer-4b141f66-de8e-506c-a57a-d99a3a23fc93" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-4b141f66-de8e-506c-a57a-d99a3a23fc93" :answer/value "-76-(y+4)^{2}"] ["answer-3662e5af-46a7-5722-9ccd-5d2228b374fe" :answer/id #uuid "3662e5af-46a7-5722-9ccd-5d2228b374fe"] ["answer-3662e5af-46a7-5722-9ccd-5d2228b374fe" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-3662e5af-46a7-5722-9ccd-5d2228b374fe" :answer/value "16-(y-4)^{2}"] ["answer-ec3c2400-2c72-5f8d-b4b6-ba5f48a46492" :answer/id #uuid "ec3c2400-2c72-5f8d-b4b6-ba5f48a46492"] ["answer-ec3c2400-2c72-5f8d-b4b6-ba5f48a46492" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-ec3c2400-2c72-5f8d-b4b6-ba5f48a46492" :answer/value "4-(y+4)^{2}"] ["answer-354b6c4f-e84d-5b59-96f6-ec5ff4ca3b16" :answer/id #uuid "354b6c4f-e84d-5b59-96f6-ec5ff4ca3b16"] ["answer-354b6c4f-e84d-5b59-96f6-ec5ff4ca3b16" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-354b6c4f-e84d-5b59-96f6-ec5ff4ca3b16" :answer/value "60-(y-4)^{2}"] ["answer-field-f3ff7a4b-bfcf-57eb-b578-4dd542e44b32" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-f3ff7a4b-bfcf-57eb-b578-4dd542e44b32" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-f3ff7a4b-bfcf-57eb-b578-4dd542e44b32" :answer-field/correct "answer-b2f33409-e27b-5ceb-ba94-f59981011277"] ["answer-field-f3ff7a4b-bfcf-57eb-b578-4dd542e44b32" :answer-field/choices "answer-b2f33409-e27b-5ceb-ba94-f59981011277"] ["answer-field-f3ff7a4b-bfcf-57eb-b578-4dd542e44b32" :answer-field/choices "answer-4b141f66-de8e-506c-a57a-d99a3a23fc93"] ["answer-field-f3ff7a4b-bfcf-57eb-b578-4dd542e44b32" :answer-field/choices "answer-3662e5af-46a7-5722-9ccd-5d2228b374fe"] ["answer-field-f3ff7a4b-bfcf-57eb-b578-4dd542e44b32" :answer-field/choices "answer-ec3c2400-2c72-5f8d-b4b6-ba5f48a46492"] ["answer-field-f3ff7a4b-bfcf-57eb-b578-4dd542e44b32" :answer-field/choices "answer-354b6c4f-e84d-5b59-96f6-ec5ff4ca3b16"] ["question-bb8a5938-134a-51c9-838d-3e4010a8ca50" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-f3ff7a4b-bfcf-57eb-b578-4dd542e44b32"] [17592186184211 :knowledge-point/questions "question-bb8a5938-134a-51c9-838d-3e4010a8ca50"] ["question-e52c4055-fdc4-580f-9736-b9940edca056" :question/id #uuid "e52c4055-fdc4-580f-9736-b9940edca056"] ["question-e52c4055-fdc4-580f-9736-b9940edca056" :question/math-academy-id "q-25252"] ["question-e52c4055-fdc4-580f-9736-b9940edca056" :question/problem "Rewrite $-{a}^{2}-10a+16$ by completing the square."] ["question-e52c4055-fdc4-580f-9736-b9940edca056" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the leading coefficient is $-1.$ So, we take out a factor of $-1$ from the entire expression:\n\n$$\n-({a}^{2}+10a-16)\n$$\n\nLet's now complete the square for the expression inside the parentheses:\n\n$$\n{a}^{2}+10a-16\n$$\n\nFirst, we rewrite the coefficient of the linear term as a product with $2$ as a factor:\n\n$$\n{a}^{2}+2\\cdot 5a-16\n$$\n\nThen, we add and then subtract ${5}^{2},$ writing the constant term $16$ last:\n\n$$\n{{a}^{2}+2\\cdot 5a+{5}^{2}}_{⏟}-{5}^{2}-16\n$$\n\nThe first three terms form a perfect square, which we factor as follows:\n\n$$\n(a+5)^{2}-{5}^{2}-16\n$$\n\nEvaluating the last two terms, we get\n\n$$\n(a+5)^{2}-41\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute this result back into our original expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}16-10a-{a}^{2} & =-((a+5)^{2}-41) \\\\  & =-(a+5)^{2}+41 \\\\  & =41-(a+5)^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-e52c4055-fdc4-580f-9736-b9940edca056" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-109e1a5c-722e-5d5b-b384-b35a60da59b9" :answer-field/id #uuid "109e1a5c-722e-5d5b-b384-b35a60da59b9"] ["answer-11fa85ec-5f23-5583-a1e2-3b339c957d2a" :answer/id #uuid "11fa85ec-5f23-5583-a1e2-3b339c957d2a"] ["answer-11fa85ec-5f23-5583-a1e2-3b339c957d2a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-11fa85ec-5f23-5583-a1e2-3b339c957d2a" :answer/value "-25-(a+5)^{2}"] ["answer-dbffa828-6ec7-5c64-9988-48bed410abc3" :answer/id #uuid "dbffa828-6ec7-5c64-9988-48bed410abc3"] ["answer-dbffa828-6ec7-5c64-9988-48bed410abc3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-dbffa828-6ec7-5c64-9988-48bed410abc3" :answer/value "16-(a+5)^{2}"] ["answer-b6d26802-0604-5ec9-a6dd-63413f57143a" :answer/id #uuid "b6d26802-0604-5ec9-a6dd-63413f57143a"] ["answer-b6d26802-0604-5ec9-a6dd-63413f57143a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b6d26802-0604-5ec9-a6dd-63413f57143a" :answer/value "25-(a-5)^{2}"] ["answer-20d0d9be-3816-5756-9034-3199caae3743" :answer/id #uuid "20d0d9be-3816-5756-9034-3199caae3743"] ["answer-20d0d9be-3816-5756-9034-3199caae3743" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-20d0d9be-3816-5756-9034-3199caae3743" :answer/value "41-(a+5)^{2}"] ["answer-6f8b8549-d167-5182-a05e-094b9fd3a421" :answer/id #uuid "6f8b8549-d167-5182-a05e-094b9fd3a421"] ["answer-6f8b8549-d167-5182-a05e-094b9fd3a421" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-6f8b8549-d167-5182-a05e-094b9fd3a421" :answer/value "9-(a-5)^{2}"] ["answer-field-109e1a5c-722e-5d5b-b384-b35a60da59b9" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-109e1a5c-722e-5d5b-b384-b35a60da59b9" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-109e1a5c-722e-5d5b-b384-b35a60da59b9" :answer-field/correct "answer-20d0d9be-3816-5756-9034-3199caae3743"] ["answer-field-109e1a5c-722e-5d5b-b384-b35a60da59b9" :answer-field/choices "answer-11fa85ec-5f23-5583-a1e2-3b339c957d2a"] ["answer-field-109e1a5c-722e-5d5b-b384-b35a60da59b9" :answer-field/choices "answer-dbffa828-6ec7-5c64-9988-48bed410abc3"] ["answer-field-109e1a5c-722e-5d5b-b384-b35a60da59b9" :answer-field/choices "answer-b6d26802-0604-5ec9-a6dd-63413f57143a"] ["answer-field-109e1a5c-722e-5d5b-b384-b35a60da59b9" :answer-field/choices "answer-20d0d9be-3816-5756-9034-3199caae3743"] ["answer-field-109e1a5c-722e-5d5b-b384-b35a60da59b9" :answer-field/choices "answer-6f8b8549-d167-5182-a05e-094b9fd3a421"] ["question-e52c4055-fdc4-580f-9736-b9940edca056" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-109e1a5c-722e-5d5b-b384-b35a60da59b9"] [17592186184211 :knowledge-point/questions "question-e52c4055-fdc4-580f-9736-b9940edca056"] [17592186184483 :question/problem "Rewrite $-({y}^{2}-5y+6)$ by completing the square."] [17592186184483 :question/worked-solution "We begin by completing the square for the expression inside the parentheses:\n\n$$\n{y}^{2}-5y+6\n$$\n\nFirst, we rewrite the coefficient of the linear term as a product with $2$ as a factor:\n\n$$\n{y}^{2}-2\\cdot \\frac{5}{2}y+6\n$$\n\nThen, we *add* and *then subtract* ${(\\frac{5}{2})}^{2},$ writing the constant term $6$ last:\n\n$$\n{{y}^{2}-2\\cdot \\frac{5}{2}y+{(\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}}_{⏟}-{(\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}+6\n$$\n\nThe first three terms form a perfect square, which we factor as follows:\n\n$$\n{(y-\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}-{(\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}+6\n$$\n\nEvaluating the last two terms, we get\n\n$$\n{(y-\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}-\\frac{1}{4}.\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute this result back into our original expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-({y}^{2}-5y+6) & =-({(y-\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}-\\frac{1}{4}) \\\\  & =-{(y-\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}+\\frac{1}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}-{(y-\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186184483 :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-91d492cf-1c56-56df-bd04-4aabaf69aec4" :answer/id #uuid "91d492cf-1c56-56df-bd04-4aabaf69aec4"] ["answer-91d492cf-1c56-56df-bd04-4aabaf69aec4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-91d492cf-1c56-56df-bd04-4aabaf69aec4" :answer/value "31-{(y+\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}"] ["answer-0d6b0b59-5f4d-58eb-aec7-42d212af1618" :answer/id #uuid "0d6b0b59-5f4d-58eb-aec7-42d212af1618"] ["answer-0d6b0b59-5f4d-58eb-aec7-42d212af1618" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-0d6b0b59-5f4d-58eb-aec7-42d212af1618" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}-{(y-\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}"] ["answer-6969fc79-b38b-551a-bfdf-07495efdaf43" :answer/id #uuid "6969fc79-b38b-551a-bfdf-07495efdaf43"] ["answer-6969fc79-b38b-551a-bfdf-07495efdaf43" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-6969fc79-b38b-551a-bfdf-07495efdaf43" :answer/value "\\frac{25}{4}-{(y-\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}"] ["answer-fc78b4ea-4ddc-5ed1-8637-95f6e755fa4c" :answer/id #uuid "fc78b4ea-4ddc-5ed1-8637-95f6e755fa4c"] ["answer-fc78b4ea-4ddc-5ed1-8637-95f6e755fa4c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-fc78b4ea-4ddc-5ed1-8637-95f6e755fa4c" :answer/value "\\frac{49}{4}-{(y+\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}"] ["answer-0710913b-7399-5b9e-a5a9-f4627344dd74" :answer/id #uuid "0710913b-7399-5b9e-a5a9-f4627344dd74"] ["answer-0710913b-7399-5b9e-a5a9-f4627344dd74" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-0710913b-7399-5b9e-a5a9-f4627344dd74" :answer/value "\\frac{5}{4}-{(y-\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}"] [17592186181075 :answer-field/correct "answer-0d6b0b59-5f4d-58eb-aec7-42d212af1618"] [17592186181075 :answer-field/choices "answer-91d492cf-1c56-56df-bd04-4aabaf69aec4"] [17592186181075 :answer-field/choices "answer-0d6b0b59-5f4d-58eb-aec7-42d212af1618"] [17592186181075 :answer-field/choices "answer-6969fc79-b38b-551a-bfdf-07495efdaf43"] [17592186181075 :answer-field/choices "answer-fc78b4ea-4ddc-5ed1-8637-95f6e755fa4c"] [17592186181075 :answer-field/choices "answer-0710913b-7399-5b9e-a5a9-f4627344dd74"] ["question-52455c8c-f427-542e-9cf2-e8b407fdf74f" :question/id #uuid "52455c8c-f427-542e-9cf2-e8b407fdf74f"] ["question-52455c8c-f427-542e-9cf2-e8b407fdf74f" :question/math-academy-id "q-140407"] ["question-52455c8c-f427-542e-9cf2-e8b407fdf74f" :question/problem "Rewrite $-{y}^{2}+9y-21$ by completing the square."] ["question-52455c8c-f427-542e-9cf2-e8b407fdf74f" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the leading coefficient is $-1.$ So, we take out a factor of $-1$ from the entire expression:\n\n$$\n-({y}^{2}-9y+21)\n$$\n\nLet's now complete the square for the expression inside the parentheses:\n\n$$\n{y}^{2}-9y+21\n$$\n\nFirst, we rewrite the coefficient of the linear term as a product with $2$ as a factor:\n\n$$\n{y}^{2}-2\\cdot \\frac{9}{2}y+21\n$$\n\nThen, we *add* and *then subtract* ${(\\frac{9}{2})}^{2},$ writing the constant term $21$ last:\n\n$$\n{{y}^{2}-2\\cdot \\frac{9}{2}y+{(\\frac{9}{2})}^{2}}_{⏟}-{(\\frac{9}{2})}^{2}+21\n$$\n\nThe first three terms form a perfect square, which we factor as follows:\n\n$$\n{(y-\\frac{9}{2})}^{2}-{(\\frac{9}{2})}^{2}+21\n$$\n\nEvaluating the last two terms, we get\n\n$$\n{(y-\\frac{9}{2})}^{2}+\\frac{3}{4}.\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute this result back into our original expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{y}^{2}+9y-21 & =-({(y-\\frac{9}{2})}^{2}+\\frac{3}{4}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{4}-{(y-\\frac{9}{2})}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-52455c8c-f427-542e-9cf2-e8b407fdf74f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-416ac210-0c5c-5b57-b96d-e01801ddf600" :answer-field/id #uuid "416ac210-0c5c-5b57-b96d-e01801ddf600"] ["answer-564dbae7-bea0-5bb4-b219-b6f52f82ad54" :answer/id #uuid "564dbae7-bea0-5bb4-b219-b6f52f82ad54"] ["answer-564dbae7-bea0-5bb4-b219-b6f52f82ad54" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-564dbae7-bea0-5bb4-b219-b6f52f82ad54" :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{2}+{(y-\\frac{9}{2})}^{2}"] ["answer-0e2a5228-4d34-5c57-8a6c-a3feb