n$$\n{x}^{2}-2\\cdot \\frac{3}{2}x\n$$\n\nThen, we *add* and *then subtract* ${(\\frac{3}{2})}^{2}:$ \n\n$$\n{{x}^{2}-2\\cdot \\frac{3}{2}x+{(\\frac{3}{2})}^{2}}_{⏟}-{(\\frac{3}{2})}^{2}\n$$\n\nThe first three terms form a perfect square, which we factor as follows:\n\n$$\n{(x-\\frac{3}{2})}^{2}-{(\\frac{3}{2})}^{2}\n$$\n\nEvaluating the last term, we get\n\n$$\n{(x-\\frac{3}{2})}^{2}-\\frac{9}{4}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute this result back into our original expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7({x}^{2}-3x) & =7({(x-\\frac{3}{2})}^{2}-\\frac{9}{4}) \\\\  & =7{(x-\\frac{3}{2})}^{2}-7\\cdot \\frac{9}{4} \\\\  & =7{(x-\\frac{3}{2})}^{2}-\\frac{63}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-a3f44aac-b56c-541f-849d-0822403501d2" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] ["answer-field-f7c32e90-669a-52ff-9868-695c63e890c3" :answer-field/id #uuid "f7c32e90-669a-52ff-9868-695c63e890c3"] ["answer-c7a8f032-2fca-5906-b4f7-ab9bf75bf249" :answer/id #uuid "c7a8f032-2fca-5906-b4f7-ab9bf75bf249"] ["answer-c7a8f032-2fca-5906-b4f7-ab9bf75bf249" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-c7a8f032-2fca-5906-b4f7-ab9bf75bf249" :answer/value "7{(x-\\frac{3}{2})}^{2}-\\frac{49}{4}"] ["answer-5b9c5aa0-fb14-5496-9591-622a3ce17833" :answer/id #uuid "5b9c5aa0-fb14-5496-9591-622a3ce17833"] ["answer-5b9c5aa0-fb14-5496-9591-622a3ce17833" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-5b9c5aa0-fb14-5496-9591-622a3ce17833" :answer/value "7{(x-\\frac{3}{2})}^{2}-\\frac{63}{4}"] ["answer-0b2204f3-0b9c-5716-8b12-1daaa8e9c98c" :answer/id #uuid "0b2204f3-0b9c-5716-8b12-1daaa8e9c98c"] ["answer-0b2204f3-0b9c-5716-8b12-1daaa8e9c98c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-0b2204f3-0b9c-5716-8b12-1daaa8e9c98c" :answer/value "7{(x-\\frac{3}{4})}^{2}-\\frac{9}{4}"] ["answer-4dcec967-e7ae-5ddf-bf71-07068fba0434" :answer/id #uuid "4dcec967-e7ae-5ddf-bf71-07068fba0434"] ["answer-4dcec967-e7ae-5ddf-bf71-07068fba0434" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-4dcec967-e7ae-5ddf-bf71-07068fba0434" :answer/value "{(7x-\\fra